@PadelBooking.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5018
@AdminToken = paste-jwt-here

### Public availability
GET {{PadelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/available?date=2030-08-01
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a public batch booking
POST {{PadelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "96891234567",
  "customerName": null,
  "email": null,
  "paymentMethod": "Cash",
  "slots": [
    {
      "bookingDate": "2030-08-01",
      "startTime": "10:00:00",
      "hours": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### Search bookings as an administrator
GET {{PadelBooking.API_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/search?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
